{"sections":[{"slug":"Fourier变换","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Fourier变换"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Fourier 变换"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部紧</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部紧Abel群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部紧</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathbb{C}$-<span lang=\"zh\">值可积函数</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong>Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Pontryagin对偶","text":"Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {G} = \\operatorname{Hom}(G,\\mathbb T)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的函数</span> $\\widehat {f}$,\n$$\r\n\\widehat {f}(\\chi) = \\int_G f(g)\\overline{\\chi(g)} dg.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">记算子</span> $f\\mapsto \\widehat {f}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal F$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">运算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于可积函数</span> $f,g\\in L^1(G)$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/卷积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":" $f*g$,\n$$\r\n(f*g)(x)  = \\int_G f(xy^{-1}) g(y)\\,d\\mu(y).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>.\n$\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">将卷积变为函数的乘积</span>:\n$$\r\n\\widehat {f*g} = \\widehat {f}\\cdot \\widehat {g}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范数</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ($L^1$–$C_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>, Riemann–Lebesgue <span lang=\"zh\">引理</span>).\nFourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span> $\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $L^1(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $C_0(\\widehat G)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ($L^2$, Plancherel <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>).\nFourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span> $\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $L^2(G)$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">等距同构地</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $L^2 (\\widehat G)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> (Hausdorff–Young <span lang=\"zh\">不等式</span>).\n<span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $p,q\\geq 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $1/p+1/q = 1$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span> $\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $L^p(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $L^q (\\widehat G)$, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span>\n$$\r\n\\|\\widehat f\\|_q\\leq \\|f\\|_p.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这是</span> Riesz–Thorin <span lang=\"zh\">插值定理的推论</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$(\\mathbb{R}_+,\\times)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Haar <span lang=\"zh\">测度为</span> $\\dfrac{dx}{x}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">对偶可视为</span> $i\\mathbb{R}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $i\\xi\\in i\\mathbb{R}$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应于同态</span> $\\mathbb{R}_+\\to\\mathbb T$, $x\\mapsto x^{i\\xi}$.</p>\n<p>$\\mathbb{R}_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的函数</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换为</span>\n$$\r\n\\widehat{f}\\colon i\\xi \\mapsto \\int_{\\mathbb{R}_+} f(x) x^{-i\\xi} dx.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这与</span> Mellin <span lang=\"zh\">变换有关</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}